            "review_text": "FarAway59461466562\n3 contributions\n0\nThe food is delicious like the childhood’s taste\nMar 2026 • Friends\nGood traditional broken rice with BBQ Pork. Must try 👍🏻👍🏻 the sauce is not too sweet, I love it. The restaurant is clean and convenience for a quick lunch or dinner. My friend tried Bun Cha also yummy\nInsider tip:\nIt is a bit crowded at lunch time. But the space has air conditioner, we waited for 10 minutes. For dinner, it may less heavy traffic.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 5, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
