            "review_text": "Nwad\nWokingham, United Kingdom201 contributions\n0\nBad Food, Rude Staff & Ripped off ….. AVOID AT ALL COSTS!!\nMar 2025 • Couples\nSadly, this place was a deeply disappointing experience. The food was greasy, bland and utterly unmemorable. The staff were consistently rude. The place was not clean and to compound everything our bill was 667 VND, but when we received our credit card bill they had charged us 1200 VND!\nInsider tip:\nAVOID AT ALL COSTS. THERE IS NOTHING ABOUT THIS RESTAURANT THAT MAKES IT A GONTO PLACE.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 4, 2025",
