            "review_text": "Dr Les\nTamworth, Australia473 contributions\n0\nDinner at Nang Tam\nAug 2024 • Couples\nWe stopped here for dinner after the young woman invited us to look through the menu. \nThis is a small restaurant that caters for families, students, and travellers. There is a set menu to choose from and service was quick. The staff were friendly and some of them spoke English. \nCheap place to eat traditional Vietnamese food. \nFruit juices are exceptional and cheaper than beer!\nRead more\nWritten August 28, 2024",
